---
description: Response length. Answers stay short, no essays.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Brevity

- Answer in 3 sentences or fewer unless asked for detail. Yes/no questions get a yes/no plus one clause.
- No headers, no bold labels, no multi-section breakdowns. One short paragraph, or a list of at most 3 lines.
- No restating context, findings, or prior turns. No "worth flagging" asides. Blockers get one sentence.
- After code changes: file paths only.
- One probe or check per question. Do not keep polling, re-verifying, or exploring past what the answer needs.
